# Dockerfile 专用上下文：只允许 Web 构建所需源码和共享合同，绝不带入 config/ 或本地依赖。
**

!apps/
!apps/web/
!apps/web/**
apps/web/node_modules/
apps/web/.next/
apps/web/coverage/
apps/web/playwright-report/
apps/web/test-results/
apps/web/*.tsbuildinfo

!packages/
!packages/contracts/
!packages/contracts/**
packages/**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
